 =E2=80=9Cnew user=E2=80=9D profile for amplifier that codifies a lot of be=
st practices, and=E2=80=A6probably more. And I was distracted in meetings m=
ost of the week. </span></p></div></div><div data-component-name=3D"Footnot=
eToDOM" class=3D"footnote"><a id=3D"footnote-2" href=3D"https://sundaylette=
rsfromsam.substack.com/p/attention-and-collaboration-in-the#footnote-anchor=
-2" contenteditable=3D"false" target=3D"_self" class=3D"footnote-number">2<=
/a><div class=3D"footnote-content"><p>It=E2=80=99s interesting to note - 10=
 years ago, no one was distracted in meetings, just bored. Now, I never hav=
e meetings where everyone is fully focused: it=E2=80=99s always the case th=
at folks have things going on in laptops or phones, in the background. It=
=E2=80=99s become the new norm. </p></div></div></div></div><div class=3D"v=
